{:3950} ' &,15: convan
	&"{f6}"
	&"&{comma}15   Convert Date{f6}"
	&"&{comma}15{comma}1 Title Case{f6}"
	&"&{comma}15{comma}2 Decode Function Keys{f6}"
' they both point to same call
