{:6450} ' &,65: convert
{:sub.convert}
' assumptions:
' define an$

' &,65,0: convnam (check for ' in string, lowercase character afterwards?)
' - test: an$="O'MALLEY'S BAR" (two apostrophes) -> "O'malley's Bar" (really should be "O'Malley's" but I picked an edge case on purpose)
' - result: an$="" (?)
